[ti:I Tell Me Ma]
[ar:Traditional]
[00:00.00]I'll tell me ma when I go home
[00:04.32]The boys won't leave the girls alone
[00:08.40]They pulled my hair, they stole my comb
[00:12.48]But that's all right till I go home
[00:16.56]She is handsome, she is pretty
[00:20.72]She is the belle of Belfast city
[00:24.72]She is courting, one two three
[00:28.80]Please won't you tell me, who is she?
